[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   (step_140).  If Gaia astrometry locks the spatial coordinates, a real
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   leg-time slip cannot be absorbed into the fitted elements: it must
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   surface in the channels the fit cannot pin down -- the cross-arc leg
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   misfit, the leg-vs-leg disagreement, the fitted non-gravitational
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   parameters (A1/A2/DT) the catalogue adds to close its residuals, and
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   the time-domain element uncertainties (sigma_tp, sigma_M).
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   Products (all from stored records -- no new integrations):
