[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   displaced axis, per composition stratum.  Sink prediction: the
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   in/out gap inverts relative to the element-space gap on
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   uniform-Gaia legs.
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   - T3: non-gravitational-solution rate (A1/A2 present in the SBDB
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   model_pars block) in-cap vs out-cap per stratum.
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   - T4: among NG-solution members, |A1|/sig, |A2|/sig, |DT| cap
[2026-09-20 12:25:35 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 142]   contrasts.
